%% Issue #48 (ADR-0003 rule 2): hyperref is configured here, never loaded.
%% The package's own load hook fires exactly when hyperref loads -- before or
%% after this package -- and never fires if it is absent. An inline
%% \@ifpackageloaded would run first and silently configure nothing, because
